    "chest pain", "can't breathe", "cannot breathe", "difficulty breathing", "shortness of breath", "unconscious", "fainted",
    "stroke", "seizure", "suicide", "kill myself", "self harm", "severe bleeding", "heavy bleeding", "vomiting blood", "blood in vomit",
